const categories=['全部 Skills','编程开发','网站与设计','文档与办公','数据与分析','搜索与研究','内容与运营','个人娱乐'];
const paths={code:'M8 7 3 12l5 5m8-10 5 5-5 5M14 4l-4 16',doc:'M6 3h9l4 4v14H6zM14 3v5h5M9 12h7M9 16h7',chart:'M4 3v17h17M8 16v-5m5 5V7m5 9V4',search:'M16 16l5 5M18 10a8 8 0 1 1-16 0 8 8 0 0 1 16 0',dice:'M5 3h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2ZM7 7h.01M17 7h.01M12 12h.01M7 17h.01M17 17h.01',map:'M3 5l6-2 6 2 6-2v16l-6 2-6-2-6 2ZM9 3v16M15 5v16',film:'M3 4h18v16H3zM7 4v16M17 4v16M3 9h4m-4 6h4M17 9h4m-4 6h4M10 8l5 4-5 4z',spark:'M12 3l2.5 6.5L21 12l-6.5 2.5L12 21l-2.5-6.5L3 12l6.5-2.5ZM19 2v4m-2-2h4',palette:'M12 3a9 9 0 1 0 0 18c3 0 1-4 3-5 2-1 6 1 6-4a9 9 0 0 0-9-9ZM7 8h.01M12 6h.01M17 9h.01M6 13h.01',layout:'M3 4h18v16H3ZM3 9h18M9 9v11',slides:'M3 3h18v13H3zM12 16v5M7 21l5-3 5 3M7 8h4M7 11h8',message:'M3 4h18v13H9l-6 4zM7 8h10M7 12h7',check:'M9 12l2 2 5-6M5 3h14v18H5z',arrow:'M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5',download:'M12 3v12m-5-5 5 5 5-5M4 16v5h16v-5',input:'M3 12h11m-4-4 4 4-4 4M14 4h6v16h-6',output:'M10 4H4v16h6M10 12h11m-4-4 4 4-4 4',shield:'M12 3l8 3v6c0 5-8 9-8 9s-8-4-8-9V6zM8 12l3 3 5-6',clock:'M12 8v5l3 2M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0',book:'M3 4h6l3 2 3-2h6v15h-6l-3 2-3-2H3zM12 6v15',copy:'M9 9h12v12H9zM15 9V3H3v12h6',filter:'M3 5h18M6 12h12M9 19h6',external:'M14 3h7v7M21 3l-10 10M10 3H3v18h18v-7'};
const svg=(type,cls='')=>`<svg class="line-icon ${cls}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="${paths[type]||paths.book}"/></svg>`;
const icon=t=>`<span class="icon">${svg(t)}</span>`;
const esc=s=>String(s).replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
const rows=window.SKILL_CATALOG.map(r=>{const source=window.SKILL_SOURCES.find(s=>s.repo===r.repo&&s.path.endsWith('/'+(r.folder||r.slug)+'/SKILL.md'));if(!source)throw new Error('Missing source '+r.id);const license=r.repo==='anthropics/skills'?'Apache-2.0':'MIT';return {...r,...source,license,sourceUrl:`https://github.com/${r.repo}/blob/${source.sha}/${source.path}`,folderUrl:`https://github.com/${r.repo}/tree/${source.sha}/${source.path.replace('/SKILL.md','')}`,licenseUrl:`https://github.com/${r.repo}/blob/${source.sha}/`+(r.repo==='anthropics/skills'?source.path.replace('SKILL.md','LICENSE.txt'):r.repo==='vercel-labs/agent-skills'?'README.md#license':r.repo.startsWith('K-Dense')?'LICENSE.md':'LICENSE')};});
const app=document.querySelector('#app');let category=0,query='',sort='recommended',publisher='all',scroll=0;
const scene=(n,extra='')=>`<div class="scene scene-${n} ${extra}" aria-hidden="true"><span>用途示意</span></div>`;
function card(r){return `<a class="skill" href="#skill/${r.id}" aria-label="查看${esc(r.name)}">${scene(r.scene)}<div class="skill-body"><div class="skill-top">${icon(r.icon)}<div><h3>${r.name}</h3><small>${r.slug}</small></div></div><p class="summary">${r.summary}</p><dl class="io"><div><dt>${svg('input')}你提供</dt><dd>${r.input}</dd></div><div><dt>${svg('output')}你得到</dt><dd>${r.output}</dd></div></dl><div class="tags">${r.tags.map(t=>`<span class="tag">${esc(t)}</span>`).join('')}</div><div class="skill-bottom"><span>${r.author}</span><b>查看与安装 ${svg('arrow')}</b></div><div class="provenance">${svg('shield')}来源与许可已核对 <span>${r.license}</span></div></div></a>`}
function renderGrid(){let list=rows.filter(r=>(!category||r.category===categories[category])&&(publisher==='all'||r.repo===publisher)&&[r.name,r.slug,r.summary,r.author,r.category,r.input,r.output,...r.tags].join(' ').toLowerCase().includes(query.toLowerCase()));if(sort==='name')list.sort((a,b)=>a.name.localeCompare(b.name,'zh-CN'));document.querySelector('#count').textContent=`${list.length} 个`;document.querySelector('#grid').innerHTML=list.length?list.map(card).join(''):'<div class="empty"><h3>没有找到匹配的 Skill</h3><p>换个用途关键词，或清除分类与来源筛选。</p><button class="btn" id="reset">清除筛选</button></div>';document.querySelectorAll('[data-cat]').forEach(b=>{b.classList.toggle('active',+b.dataset.cat===category);b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(+b.dataset.cat===category))});document.querySelector('#active-filter').textContent=category?categories[category]:'全部用途';document.querySelector('.topics').hidden=!!query;document.querySelector('#reset')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{category=0;query='';publisher='all';document.querySelector('#search').value='';document.querySelector('#publisher').value='all';renderGrid()});}
function listing(){document.title='Skills 广场 · semifly.ai 本地目录';app.innerHTML=`<section class="hero"><div><h1>给你的 AI，添一项技能。</h1><p>把工作理顺，也给生活留点好玩的。<br>从真实的开源 Skills 开始，找到你的下一件作品。</p><div class="hero-facts"><span>${svg('book')}15 个真实 Skills</span><span>${svg('shield')}原始来源与许可可查</span><span>${svg('dice')}5 个个人娱乐玩法</span></div></div><div><label class="search">${svg('search')}<input id="search" type="search" aria-label="搜索 Skill" placeholder="想做什么？试试 GIF、跑团、PDF"></label><div class="search-note">Skill 免费获取；运行时的模型和第三方服务费用另计。</div></div></section><section class="topics" aria-label="主题入口"><button class="topic topic-dev" data-topic="1">${svg('code')}<div><b>让开发更顺手</b><span>检查代码、实现页面、验证交互</span></div>${svg('arrow')}</button><button class="topic topic-work" data-topic="3">${svg('doc')}<div><b>把材料变成成果</b><span>PDF、Word、PPT，各有专长</span></div>${svg('arrow')}</button><button class="topic topic-play" data-topic="7">${svg('dice')}<div><b>今天，玩点不一样的</b><span>跑团、表情、海报和生成艺术</span></div>${svg('arrow')}</button></section><div class="catalog"><div><button class="mobile-filter" aria-expanded="false">${svg('filter')}筛选分类</button><aside class="sidebar"><h3>按用途探索</h3><div class="categories">${categories.map((c,i)=>`<button data-cat="${i}"><span>${svg(['book','code','layout','doc','chart','search','message','dice'][i])}${c}</span><small>${i?rows.filter(r=>r.category===c).length:rows.length}</small></button>`).join('')}</div><div class="side-note"><b>${svg('shield')}验证到哪一步？</b><p>已阅读原始说明与许可，核对安装文档。尚未安装和运行，不等于安全认证或 OneAPI 兼容认证。</p><a href="source-audit.json" target="_blank">查看核验记录 ${svg('external')}</a><small>核对日期：2026-11-17</small></div></aside></div><section><div class="toolbar"><div><h2>发现 Skills <span id="count"></span></h2><p id="active-filter">全部用途</p></div><div class="filter-controls"><select id="publisher" aria-label="按来源筛选"><option value="all">全部来源</option>${[...new Set(rows.map(r=>r.repo))].map(repo=>`<option value="${repo}">${repo.split('/')[0]}</option>`).join('')}</select><select id="sort" aria-label="排序"><option value="recommended">编辑推荐顺序</option><option value="name">名称排序</option></select></div></div><div class="grid" id="grid" aria-live="polite"></div><p class="gallery-note">配图由 AI 生成，用于说明使用场景；不是 Skill 实测效果。中文简介与任务示例由本站整理。</p></section></div>`;document.querySelector('#search').value=query;document.querySelector('#sort').value=sort;document.querySelector('#publisher').value=publisher;renderGrid();document.querySelector('#search').addEventListener('input',e=>{query=e.target.value;renderGrid()});document.querySelector('#sort').addEventListener('change',e=>{sort=e.target.value;renderGrid()});document.querySelector('#publisher').addEventListener('change',e=>{publisher=e.target.value;renderGrid()});document.querySelectorAll('[data-cat],[data-topic]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{category=+(b.dataset.cat||b.dataset.topic);renderGrid();if(b.dataset.topic)document.querySelector('.catalog').scrollIntoView({block:'start'})}));document.querySelector('.mobile-filter').onclick=e=>{const open=document.querySelector('.sidebar').classList.toggle('open');e.currentTarget.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(open))};requestAnimationFrame(()=>window.scrollTo(0,scroll));}
function installCommand(r,agent='claude-code'){return `npx skills@1.9.0 add ${r.repo}@${r.sha} --skill ${r.slug} --agent ${agent}`;}
function details(id){if(id==='story')id='dungeon';const r=rows.find(r=>r.id===id);if(!r){app.innerHTML='<a class="back" href="#">← 返回广场</a><div class="empty"><h1>未找到这个 Skill</h1><p>请返回广场重新选择。</p></div>';window.scrollTo(0,0);return}document.title=`${r.name} · Skills 广场`;app.innerHTML=`<a class="back" href="#">← 返回 Skills 广场</a><section class="detail-head">${icon(r.icon)}<div><h1>${r.name}</h1><p>${r.summary}</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">${r.category}</span><span class="tag">${r.author}</span><span class="tag">${r.license} · 免费获取</span></div></div></section><div class="detail-layout"><article class="article"><figure class="detail-visual">${scene(r.scene)}<figcaption>AI 生成的用途示意图 · 非实测成果</figcaption></figure><section><h2>适合谁，能做什么</h2><p>${r.audience}</p><ul class="features">${r.features.map(f=>`<li>${svg('check')}<span>${f}</span></li>`).join('')}</ul><dl class="detail-io io"><div><dt>${svg('input')}你提供</dt><dd>${r.input}</dd></div><div><dt>${svg('output')}你得到</dt><dd>${r.output}</dd></div></dl><p class="editor-note">${svg('book')}<span><b>编辑选入理由</b>${r.recommended}</span></p></section><section><div class="sample-head"><h2>安装后，试着这样说</h2><button id="copy">${svg('copy')}复制示例</button></div><div class="sample">${r.prompt}</div><p class="example-label">本站编写的任务示例，尚未运行。</p></section><section><h2>你可以期待的交付形式</h2><div class="result-shape">${svg('output')}<p>${r.result}</p></div><p class="example-label">交付结构示意，不代表已生成这些文件。</p></section><section><h2>需要准备什么</h2><p>${r.dependencies}</p><p class="limitations"><b>使用边界</b>${r.limitations}</p></section><section id="verification"><h2>验证记录</h2><div class="verification"><div><span>${svg('shield')}原始来源与许可</span><b class="verified">已核对</b></div><div><span>${svg('book')}安装文档与 Skill 名称</span><b class="verified">已核对</b></div><div><span>${svg('download')}实际安装</span><b>未执行</b></div><div><span>${svg('check')}代表任务运行</span><b>未执行</b></div><div><span>${svg('code')}OneAPI 模型组合</span><b>未验证</b></div></div><p class="example-label">核对日期：2026-11-17。以上是文档核验，不是完整代码安全审计。</p></section><section><h2>原作者与版本</h2><div class="source-list"><a class="source" href="${r.sourceUrl}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">${svg('book')}原始 SKILL.md ${svg('external')}</a><a class="source" href="${r.folderUrl}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">${svg('code')}完整 Skill 目录 ${svg('external')}</a><a class="source" href="${r.licenseUrl}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">${svg('shield')}${r.license} 许可依据 ${svg('external')}</a></div><p class="example-label">${r.repo}<br>核对版本：<code>${r.sha}</code>${r.repo==='vercel-labs/agent-skills'?'<br>许可依据为仓库 README 的 MIT 声明；不是另行签发的认证。':''}</p></section></article><aside><div class="install"><h2>${svg('download')}安装这个 Skill</h2><p>选择你的工具，在项目目录的终端执行。默认安装到当前项目，不修改全局 Skills。</p><label class="field-label" for="agent">使用工具</label><select id="agent" class="tool-select"><option value="claude-code">Claude Code</option><option value="codex">Codex</option><option value="cursor">Cursor</option><option value="opencode">OpenCode</option></select><pre class="install-code" id="command">${esc(installCommand(r))}</pre><button class="btn primary" id="copy-command">${svg('copy')}复制安装命令</button><a class="btn" href="${r.folderUrl}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看原始文件 ${svg('external')}</a><p class="install-caption">命令固定到已核对的仓库提交，执行前需 Node.js ≥ 22.20 和 Git。npx 会获取 Skills CLI，并联网下载内容；本页不执行安装。</p><details class="install-more"><summary>安装后如何开始？</summary><ol><li>检查终端显示的 Skill 名称与安装位置，确认安装。</li><li>保留完整目录，包含脚本、参考文件及许可。</li><li>重新打开工具会话，确认识别到 <code>${r.slug}</code>。</li><li>复制左侧示例，从一个小任务开始；若报依赖缺失，按原作者说明配置。</li></ol><a class="source" href="https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills/blob/main/docs/commands.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Skills CLI 官方安装文档</a></details><div class="facts"><div class="fact"><span>Skill 费用</span><b>免费 · ${r.license}</b></div><div class="fact"><span>上手要求</span><b>${r.level}</b></div><div class="fact"><span>安装 / 运行</span><b>尚未实测</b></div></div><p class="cost-note">工具可安装此格式，不代表已与 OneAPI 完成兼容验证。模型调用、软件订阅及可选服务费用另计。</p></div></aside></div>`;document.querySelector('#copy').onclick=()=>copy(r.prompt);document.querySelector('#agent').onchange=e=>document.querySelector('#command').textContent=installCommand(r,e.target.value);document.querySelector('#copy-command').onclick=()=>copy(document.querySelector('#command').textContent);window.scrollTo(0,0);}
function toast(s){const e=document.querySelector('#toast');e.textContent=s;e.style.display='block';clearTimeout(window.toastTimer);window.toastTimer=setTimeout(()=>e.style.display='none',3000)}async function copy(s){try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(s);toast('已复制；尚未执行')}catch{toast('复制失败，请手动选择文字复制')}}function route(){if(location.hash.startsWith('#skill/'))details(location.hash.slice(7));else listing()}document.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target.closest('a[href^="#skill/"]'))scroll=window.scrollY});window.addEventListener('hashchange',route);document.querySelector('#guide').onclick=()=>document.querySelector('#help').showModal();document.querySelector('.close').onclick=()=>document.querySelector('#help').close();route();
